      <item row="0" column="0" colspan="2">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="label_2">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Details of specific operations behavior in Visual Snap may be customized below.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="wordWrap">
         <bool>true</bool>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="0">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbVisualSnapAutoAddSnapPoint">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Auto Adding Points

If checked, snap point requested by command and specified by the user will be added to visual snap automatically.
Otherwise, it should be added manually.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Add snapped point to visual snap automatically</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="2" column="0">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbVisualSnapClearSolutionByRMB">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Clearing

Visual snap solution will be cleared by CTRL+Middle Mouse Button click.
If selected, visual snap solution may be also cleared by Right Mouse Button click.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Clear visual snap solution by Right mouse button click</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="3" column="0">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbVisualSnapManualAddingWithCTRL">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Manual Adding Points

If selected, points will be added manually as guiding points if cursor is over them and CTRL key is pressed.
Otherwise - they will be added by placing cursor over only.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Manual adding points with CTRL key</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
