     <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayout_vc">
      <item row="4" column="0">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbVisualSnapVertexVertexDistancesTangential">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Tangential Rays

If selected, and both 'Snap to Distance' and 'Snap To Center' snap modes are enabled,
tangential guiding rays will be created between distance circles that are created for guiding points.
Otherwise, tangential will not be created.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Tangential rays for distance circles</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="2">
       <spacer name="horizontalSpacer_5">
        <property name="orientation">
         <enum>Qt::Orientation::Horizontal</enum>
        </property>
        <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
         <size>
          <width>0</width>
          <height>0</height>
         </size>
        </property>
       </spacer>
      </item>
      <item row="2" column="0">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbVisualSnapRaysAngleSnapRelative">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Relative Rays

If checked, visual snap will also create guiding rays for enpoints of lines from the document,
added into visual snap with step, similar to angle snap yet which is related to the line's own angle.
Otherwise, only tangential and normal rays will be considered for vertexes.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Relative step rays for lines</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="3" column="0">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbVisualSnapVertexVertexDistanceCircles">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Distance Circles

If selected, guiding circles for distances between guiding points will be included into visual snap.
Otherwise, they will be ignored. </string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Dynamic distance circles for points</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="0">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbVisualSnapRaysAngleSnapVertexes">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Rays

If checked, visual snap will also consider rays from guiding points with step, similar to angle snap.
Otherwise, only vertical and horizontal rays will be considered for vertexes.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Step rays for guiding points</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="0" column="0" colspan="3">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="label_3">
        <property name="text">
         <string>When solving project snap point, Visual Snap may rely on various geometry points and entities. Some entities are optional and may be include or excluded into Visual Snap solution.</string>
